    5. Fill guide lines with RED. Place GREEN 3x3 marker rings. This is the INPUT.
    6. To build OUTPUT: paint emitted BLUE perpendicular lines (only on BLACK cells), stamp BLUE 3x3 crossing rings (preserving RED centers), keep GREEN markers.
